#   governance/langfuse-main/     the Governance room's app        (covered by governance/)
#   product/ai-app-builder-open/  the Product room's builder app
The explicit lines sit beside the rules that already cover the other two.
development/OpenHands-main/
development/vendor/
product/ai-app-builder-open/

